From: OpenCode Memory <opencode@memory.plugin>
Date: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 10:33:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Integrate external embedding service at localhost:18000

This patch integrates an external embedding service running at
http://localhost:18000/embeddings, replacing the local HuggingFace
Transformers model. Key changes include:

1. Modified vector-store.js to use external API calls instead of local models
2. Updated package.json to remove @huggingface/transformers dependency
3. Updated install.cjs to default to external provider configuration
4. Updated documentation to reflect external service support
5. Added performance improvements with reduced memory usage
6. Maintained fallback to BM25 keyword search when external service fails

Files changed:
- opencode-memory-plugin/lib/vector-store.js (complete overhaul)
- opencode-memory-plugin/package.json (dependency removal)
- opencode-memory-plugin/bin/install.cjs (configuration update)
- README.md (documentation update)
- opencode-memory-plugin/CONFIGURATION.md (new provider documentation)

---
